VHLP

;       1st line contains the VHLP signature
;
;       Command format:
;       <command> <color> <x> <y> [parameters]
;
;       Command     Meaning     Parameters
;       -------     -------     ----------
;       T           text        <text>
;       F           fill        <x2> <y2>
;       L           line        <x2> <y2>
;       C           circle      <radius>
;
;       Note: '*' instead of numeric <x> in Text command centers text line
;             '+' before numeric <y> means displacement from the last <y>
;
;       Colors:
;       -------
;       Black      0       DarkGray      8
;       Blue       1       LightBlue     9
;       Green      2       LightGreen    10
;       Cyan       3       LightCyan     11
;       Red        4       LightRed      12
;       Magenta    5       LightMagenta  13
;       Brown      6       Yellow        14
;       LightGray  7       White         15
;
;       Keywords:
;       ---------
;       WIDTH     <help window width>
;       PAGE      <page ID>
;       KEY       <keycode> <page ID>


WIDTH   480


